  </div>
  <div class="body-text">
    Type should be typeset in Times New Roman or Calibri. The signature should be aligned flush left. The body copy is flush left—not justified. Allow two line spaces above the addressee's name, title, company name, etc., and one line above the salutation. The body copy should be flush left—not justified. Allow two line spaces between paragraphs. There are no indentations. Allow three line spaces for the signature above the name of the sender.
